dsh-memoryhub README · Prerequisites：`mh` installed and on PATH (`uv tool install git+https://github.com/solknight48/memoryhub`;
needs git ≥ 2.32, Python ≥ 3.12). The plugin shells out to it — the hub
format, git commits, and error wording stay owned by mh.

dsh-memoryhub README · 前置条件：`mh` 已安装并在 PATH 上(`uv tool install git+https://github.com/solknight48/memoryhub`;
需要 git ≥ 2.32、Python ≥ 3.12)。插件以 shell 方式调用它 —— hub 格式、git 提交、
报错措辞都归 mh 所有。
